  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "紡紗工程",
    "sub_ename": "SPINNING TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程設計係配合各機器構造介紹，使學生充分了解棉紡各個工程作用與目的，含清花、梳棉、精梳、併條、粗紡、精紡工程。學生可從課程設計中學習棉紡實務技術之原理，更進一步培養其具備設計棉紡製程條件之基本能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Let students understand soundly the functions and purposes of cotton spinning with introduction of various mechanisms, such as opening and cleaning, carding, combing, drawing, roving, and spinning. Students can learn the principles of cotton spinning by course arrangement, and then have the fundamental ability to design process conditions for cotton spinning.",
